{"script":"yd_015_08-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]嗯～今天还真是清闲，我就给你讲讲我们黑森林另一支智慧生物部族，蕈人种的故事吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]蕈人种曾是黑森林最主要的原住民。但比起亚人种，他们更像是有智慧的魔物。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]但或许是智慧占用了天赋，他们的力量比起无智的同类总是略有不足，[r]在很长的一段时间里，蕈人们都处在食物链的最底层，[r]靠着智慧和团结在黑森林中挣扎求存。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]直到蕈人中出现了一名传奇的酿造大师布拉格乌尔，[r]他酿造的蕈酵酿让蕈人们的处境第一次发生了改变。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]这种美味的绝酿俘获了所有森林住民的舌头，甚至一些森林精魂都为之沉迷。[r][l]为了与这些神奇的小生物达成交易，我们便形成了联盟，为它们抵御其他外敌。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]很有趣吧。没错，我也很喜欢他们酿的饮品。有机会来黑森林，我一定会请你一同共饮。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"芭杜尔-黑森林的住民2"}